{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frog Pond Simulator</strong> has more to offer than you may think at a first glance. We'll show you some things that you may catch your eye!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/71b864b3d8b435b62afab7cc3055e356.avif?t=1755534912\" width=1600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>pond</strong> is a place where you can make yourself <strong>comfortable</strong>, lean back and enjoy the peace and tranquility of the slowly flowing time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/54bd5acfa3057067800bab34c32cc570.poster.avif?t=1755534912\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/54bd5acfa3057067800bab34c32cc570.webm?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/54bd5acfa3057067800bab34c32cc570.mp4?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's not a thing that can rush you, only you decide when to interact with the frogs and with the environment, otherwise it will go on by itself while you <strong>rest</strong> your mind and soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/0484661e797c7e2d019aa3b4443ed51d.avif?t=1755534912\" width=1600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>weird frogs</strong> in this world of ours, but not as weird and <strong>unique</strong> as the ones in <strong>Frog Pond Simulator</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/8c3a2620b06f535bca0af2fea71fbc66.poster.avif?t=1755534912\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/8c3a2620b06f535bca0af2fea71fbc66.webm?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/8c3a2620b06f535bca0af2fea71fbc66.mp4?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every frog has something that differ, whether it is its <strong>appearance</strong>, its <strong>behavior</strong> or both. There's enough frogs for you to find <strong>your own</strong>. Which frog are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/0c45315fe1682299eaab027b57a77d68.avif?t=1755534912\" width=1600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some frogs may <strong>remind</strong> you of someone you know: maybe it's your <strong>neighbor</strong>, maybe it's your best <strong>friend</strong> or maybe it's that long lost <strong>relative</strong> of yours you knew as a kid and forgot about...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/35f2757696881c3d2156cb346b4948ff.poster.avif?t=1755534912\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/35f2757696881c3d2156cb346b4948ff.webm?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/35f2757696881c3d2156cb346b4948ff.mp4?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or maybe someone\u00a0\u2014\u00a0<strong>else</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/408fee0068e88d3cfd55fe3f119cf416.avif?t=1755534912\" width=1600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most frogs just love to <strong>lie around</strong>, <strong>jump</strong> every once in a while or go for a <strong>swim</strong>, but some of them have way more going through their minds...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...you may see them <strong>doing questionable things</strong> in the darkest of the <strong>nights</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/f9bc5924b537a82145fd8812b4d7f14a.poster.avif?t=1755534912\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/f9bc5924b537a82145fd8812b4d7f14a.webm?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/f9bc5924b537a82145fd8812b4d7f14a.mp4?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or <strong>working their jobs</strong> under the hot summer sun (we promise their paid well for that)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/d4f212fac6422e8d817afaa412d9997f.poster.avif?t=1755534912\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/d4f212fac6422e8d817afaa412d9997f.webm?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/d4f212fac6422e8d817afaa412d9997f.mp4?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either way, keep an eye on them, you never know when they're going to strike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/653318b60e7e62d2dd675e663c1fe117.avif?t=1755534912\" width=1600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's <strong>more</strong> than you can see inside the pond, if you look closely enough. Use your <strong>keen eye</strong> and your <strong>sixth sense</strong> to uncover the <strong>secrets</strong> that hide behind the still waters of <strong>Frog Pond Simulator</strong>. But don't worry, no one's going to hurry you, you have all the time in the world, just like these frogs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To Sum It Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you check in every few minutes or leave it running while you work, this pond is here to make your day a little<strong> lighter, </strong>a little <strong>sillier, </strong>and a lot more <strong><i>frog-filled</i>.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/86b60c07d2485968b62ec8fa451d1b6e.avif?t=1755534912\" data-has-big width=1600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love chill games with a touch of oddball charm\u2026 you\u2019ll feel right at home.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892380?t=1755534912","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892380?t=1755534912","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/cfbc3d58d67d2a731d371783103b61eba49714fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755534912"