g that can rush you, only you decide when to interact with the frogs and with the environment, otherwise it will go on by itself while you <strong>rest</strong> your mind and soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/0484661e797c7e2d019aa3b4443ed51d.avif?t=1755534912\" width=1600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>weird frogs</strong> in this world of ours, but not as weird and <strong>unique</strong> as the ones in <strong>Frog Pond Simulator</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/8c3a2620b06f535bca0af2fea71fbc66.poster.avif?t=1755534912\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/8c3a2620b06f535bca0af2fea71fbc66.webm?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/8c3a2620b06f535bca0af2fea71fbc66.mp4?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every frog has something that differ, whether it is its <strong>appearance</strong>, its <strong>behavior</strong> or both. There's enough frogs for you to find <strong>your own</strong>. Which frog are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/0c45315fe1682299eaab027b57a77d68.avif?t=1755534912\" width=1600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some frogs may <strong>remind</strong> you of someone you know: maybe it's your <strong>neighbor</strong>, maybe it's your best <strong>friend</strong> or maybe it's that long lost <strong>relative</strong>