a.mp4?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or <strong>working their jobs</strong> under the hot summer sun (we promise their paid well for that)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/d4f212fac6422e8d817afaa412d9997f.poster.avif?t=1755534912\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/d4f212fac6422e8d817afaa412d9997f.webm?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/d4f212fac6422e8d817afaa412d9997f.mp4?t=1755534912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either way, keep an eye on them, you never know when they're going to strike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/653318b60e7e62d2dd675e663c1fe117.avif?t=1755534912\" width=1600 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's <strong>more</strong> than you can see inside the pond, if you look closely enough. Use your <strong>keen eye</strong> and your <strong>sixth sense</strong> to uncover the <strong>secrets</strong> that hide behind the still waters of <strong>Frog Pond Simulator</strong>. But don't worry, no one's going to hurry you, you have all the time in the world, just like these frogs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To Sum It Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you check in every few minutes or leave it running while you work, this pond is here to make your day a little<strong> lighter, </strong>a little <strong>sillier, </strong>and a lot more <strong><i>frog-filled</i>.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst